{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2022-10-24 18:00:00', 'title': "EMERSON UNVEILS ARCHITECTURE VISION FOR ‘BOUNDLESS AUTOMATION'", 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUILDING ON A DEEP LEGACY OF INDUSTRY-LEADING DIGITAL AUTOMATION EXPERTISE THROUGH ITS PLANTWEB™ DIGITAL ECOSYSTEM, GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY AND SOFTWARE COMPANY EMERSON (NYSE: EMR) TODAY SHARED ITS VISION OF A NEW SOFTWARE-DEFINED AUTOMATION ARCHITECTURE DESIGNED TO CATALYZE THE FUTURE OF MODERN MANUFACTURING.'}{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2022-10-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'EMERSON EXPANDS PLANTWEB DIGITAL ECOSYSTEM WITH ASPENTECH ASSET OPTIMIZATION SOFTWARE', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LEVERAGING DECADES OF DIGITAL INNOVATION AND LEADERSHIP ACROSS ALL AUTOMATION CATEGORIES, GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY AND SOFTWARE COMPANY EMERSON (NYSE: EMR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE EVOLUTION OF THE PLANTWEB™ DIGITAL ECOSYSTEM TO INCORPORATE THE ASPENTECH (NASDAQ: AZPN) PORTFOLIO OF ASSET OPTIMIZATION SOFTWARE POWERED BY INDUSTRIAL ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE, CREATING THE MOST COMPREHENSIVE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION PORTFOLIO IN THE INDUSTRY.'}